---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Sabi Update" description="Sabi Update privacy policy.">
  <section class="page-hero container"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span><h1>Privacy policy.</h1><p>Last updated: 8 August 2026.</p></section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="reading article-body"><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>Sabi Update does not require an account to read articles. Our hosting, analytics and advertising providers may process technical information such as IP address, browser type, device information, referring pages and interactions with the site.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>We may use privacy-respecting analytics or Google Analytics to understand aggregate site usage and improve content. The exact production analytics configuration should be documented here when enabled.</p><h2>Advertising</h2><p>If advertising is enabled, advertising partners may use cookies or similar technologies as permitted by applicable law and consent requirements. This policy should be updated before ad serving is activated.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions can be sent through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
